@using System.Text.Json
@* Exercise 031 — SecretsNeverReachClient (reference solution).
   Goal:   Render the client-safe view of a settings object - implemented in
           Ex031_SecretsNeverReachClient.ToClientView - as JSON, so a leak in
           that projection would show up here too.
   Drills: configuration surface, what a component may receive.
   Passes: attack facts - the rendered output contains neither the ApiKey
                          value nor the string "ApiKey";
           use facts     - the rendered output contains the PublicBaseUrl
                          value. *@

<pre id="cfg">@Json</pre>

@code {
    [Parameter] public Ex031_ApiSettings Settings { get; set; } = new("", "");

    private string Json => JsonSerializer.Serialize(Ex031_SecretsNeverReachClient.ToClientView(Settings));
}
